---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaSection from '../components/CtaSection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Great Silk Road Tours — Multi-Country Expeditions" description="Epic Silk Road expeditions across China and Central Asia — China to Uzbekistan, Kashgar to Istanbul, Beijing to Tehran. Multi-country tours from 19 to 35 days." ogImage="/assets/images/great-wall.jpg">
<section class="page-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4),rgba(0,0,0,0.4)),url('/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg) center/cover;">
  <div class="container"><h1>Great Silk Road Expeditions</h1><p>Follow in the footsteps of Marco Polo — epic multi-country journeys from China to the Mediterranean</p></div>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://silkroadwondertours.com/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Great Silk Road" }
  ]
}
</script>
<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><div class="container"><a href="/">Home</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <span>Great Silk Road</span></div></nav>

<section class="section"><div class="container">
<div class="section-header reveal">
  <h2>The Full Silk Road Experience</h2>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <p>The Silk Road is not a single road but a vast network of trade routes that connected China with Central Asia, Persia, the Middle East, and Europe for over 1,500 years. Our Great Silk Road expeditions trace these legendary paths across multiple countries, crossing deserts and mountain passes, visiting ancient oasis cities and bustling bazaars that have thrived since the time of caravans. From the Terracotta Warriors of Xi'an to the turquoise domes of Samarkand, from the Sunday Bazaar of Kashgar to the minarets of Khiva — these are journeys of a lifetime that span cultures, landscapes, and millennia of human history.</p>
  <p style="margin-top:12px;">Our multi-country expeditions range from 19 to 35 days, with expert local guides in each country ensuring seamless border crossings and deep cultural immersion. Travel by private vehicle, high-speed train, and domestic flights to maximize your time exploring rather than traveling. Best seasons are spring (April to June) and autumn (September to October) when the weather is pleasant from the Taklamakan Desert to the Pamir Plateau. All visas are handled by our team, and 24/7 support is available throughout your journey.</p>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container">
<div class="tours-grid">
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="China Uzbekistan Tour" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">19 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$4,390</span></div>
      <h3>China to Uzbekistan</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">📍 Kashgar → Kuqa → Urumqi → Turpan → Tashkent → Samarkand → Bukhara</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">The classic two-country Silk Road — Xinjiang's desert oases and the legendary blue cities of Uzbekistan. Stand before the Registan at sunset and trace ancient caravan trails.</p>
      <a href="tour/19d-china-uzbekistan.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Full Silk Road" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">35 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$12,000</span></div>
      <h3>The Full Silk Road: China to Turkey</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">📍 Xi'an → Dunhuang → Kashgar → Samarkand → Tehran → Istanbul</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">The ultimate Silk Road odyssey — from the starting point in Xi'an to the final bazaars of Istanbul. Six countries, three continents, one epic journey across the heart of Eurasia.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Kashgar to Istanbul" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">30 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$9,800</span></div>
      <h3>Kashgar to Istanbul: The Central Route</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">📍 Kashgar → Bishkek → Tashkent → Ashgabat → Tehran → Istanbul</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Cross the Pamir Highway, explore the marble city of Ashgabat, and end at the Grand Bazaar of Istanbul. The most adventurous Silk Road route through Central Asia and Persia.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="China Kyrgyzstan Uzbekistan" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">20 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$5,200</span></div>
      <h3>China, Kyrgyzstan & Uzbekistan</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">📍 Kashgar → Naryn → Issyk Kul → Bishkek → Tashkent → Samarkand → Bukhara</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Three countries, three Silk Road cultures — from Uyghur Xinjiang through nomadic Kyrgyzstan to Timurid Uzbekistan. Alpine lakes, mountain passes, and turquoise-domed cities.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/great-wall.jpg" alt="Beijing to Tehran" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">25 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$6,500</span></div>
      <h3>Beijing to Tehran: East-West Silk Road</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">📍 Beijing → Xi'an → Dunhuang → Kashgar → Samarkand → Tehran</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Begin in China's imperial capital, trace the Silk Road through the Hexi Corridor, cross into Central Asia, and arrive in Persia. Two ancient civilizations connected by one legendary route.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Karakoram Highway" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">23 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$5,500</span></div>
      <h3>China to Pakistan via Karakoram Highway</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">📍 Kashgar → Taxkorgan → Khunjerab Pass → Hunza → Gilgit → Islamabad</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Drive the world's highest paved international road — the legendary KKH. Cross 4,693-meter Khunjerab Pass into the fairy-tale Hunza Valley beneath Rakaposhi's 7,788m peak.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="China Mongolia Russia" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">22 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$5,800</span></div>
      <h3>China, Mongolia & Russia: The Northern Route</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">📍 Beijing → Ulaanbaatar → Gobi → Lake Baikal → Irkutsk → Moscow</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">The Silk Road's northern branch — Mongolian steppes, the Gobi Desert, the world's deepest lake Baikal, and the Trans-Siberian Railway. Nomadic culture meets Tsarist grandeur.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="cta-section"><div class="container"><div class="cta-grid">
  <div class="cta-text reveal"><h2>Ready for the Journey of a Lifetime?</h2><p>Let us design your epic multi-country Silk Road expedition — visas, logistics, and 24/7 support included.</p><a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">Start Planning</a></div>
</div></div></section>
<CtaSection />
</BaseLayout>